<p>You have my upvote for the line about extraterrestrial activity. When aliens are a better explanation than what's actually going on, shit's wrong.</p>
<p>The discharge events were creative. The journal is a pretty decent &quot;descent into madness&quot; kind of thing, and isn't overly explainy. The exploration log, though, left me a tad confused, so just to check: entering the archways will cause a person to disappear and a discharge event to happen. But this doesn't happen immediately, and it's possible for discharge events to happen on their own. Somehow, as I was reading, I got the idea that discharge was <em>only</em> caused by people going in the archways, and it kind of sounds like the effect should be immediate from the description.</p>

